From 1f7d9b127465b5b307503b5f464c08caa79c648d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 20:28:04 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] GPU-aware MPI: option --gpu-aware-mpi of initialize

MFEM, hypre (if it computes on the GPU) and AmgX (communicator MPI_DIRECT) give the arrays on the GPU to MPI, without copies on the host. Also given by the variable MFEM_MGIS_GPU_AWARE_MPI. Refused without a device of MFEM using a GPU, or if Open MPI states that it can't read the memory of the GPUs.
---
 CHANGELOG.md                    |   3 +
 include/MFEMMGIS/Config.hxx     |  19 ++++-
 src/AmgXSolvers.cxx             |  12 +++-
 src/Config.cxx                  | 118 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 tests/CMakeLists.txt            |  77 ++++++++++++++++++++-
 tests/GPUAwareMPIOptionTest.cxx |  76 ++++++++++++++++++++
 6 files changed, 299 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/GPUAwareMPIOptionTest.cxx

